  "title": "Battle of Verdun",
  "summary": "The German attack at Verdun began at 7.15am on 21 February 1916 on the hills north of the town in northeastern France and ended on 18 December 1916. The Memorial de Verdun counts 163,000 French and 143,000 German dead; the National Army Museum gives around 330,000 German and over 370,000 French casualties. The offensive failed to force France to make peace.",
